var POSTS=[["Bajeti ya mwanachuo si tatizo, mfumo wako ndio","Your student budget isn’t broken. Your system is.",["Kila muhula wanachuo wengi hubaki bila pesa kabla muda haujaisha. Mara nyingi tatizo si kiasi, ni usimamizi.","Biblia inasema mjenzi hukaa kwanza akahesabu gharama (Luka 14:28). Anza na hatua nne: toa kwanza (Mithali 3:9-10), andika matumizi kwa wiki nne, tenganisha mahitaji na matamanio, na weka akiba kabla ya dharura.","Tumia kikokotoo cha bajeti kwenye mfumo huu kuona mgawo wako kwa nambari."],["Every semester many students run out of money before the term ends. Often the problem is not the amount but the management.","The Bible says a builder first sits down and counts the cost (Luke 14:28). Start with four steps: give first (Proverbs 3:9-10), track spending for four weeks, separate needs from wants, and save before emergencies.","Use the budget calculator in this system to see your split in numbers."]],["Hatari ya kimya ya deni la wanafunzi","The quiet danger of student debt",["Mkopo unaweza kufungua mlango wa elimu, au kufunga mlango wa maisha yako ya baadaye ukishughulikiwa ovyo. “Mkopaji ni mtumwa wa mkopeshaji” (Mithali 22:7).","Kabla ya kukopa jiulize: nafadhili elimu au starehe? Naelewa riba na masharti? Nina mpango wa kipato baada ya chuo? Nimehesabu gharama (Luka 14:28)?","Epuka mikopo ya haraka ya simu inayoitwa msaada: ni rahisi kukopa, na ghali kulipa."],["A loan can open the door to education, or close the door on your future if handled carelessly. “The borrower is slave to the lender” (Proverbs 22:7).","Before borrowing ask: am I funding education or lifestyle? Do I understand the interest and terms? Do I have an income plan after university? Have I counted the cost (Luke 14:28)?","Avoid quick phone loans that call themselves help: easy to borrow, costly to repay."]],["Uaminifu kwa mambo madogo: kazi huanzia chuoni","Faithful in small things: a career begins at university",["Wengi wanadhani kazi huanza siku ya kuhitimu. Huanza kwenye mambo madogo ambayo hakuna anayeyashangilia: kazi uliyowasilisha kwa wakati, sehemu yako kwenye kikundi, kibarua unachofanya kwa uaminifu.","Yesu alisema aliye mwaminifu katika lililo dogo ni mwaminifu pia katika lililo kubwa (Luka 16:10). Fanya kila kitu kwa moyo kama kumfanyia Bwana (Wakolosai 3:23).","Gundua kipawa chako, kikuze kila siku, na ukitumie kutumikia (1 Petro 4:10)."],["Many think a career begins on graduation day. It begins in small things nobody applauds: the assignment handed in on time, your share of the group work, the part-time job done honestly.","Jesus said whoever is faithful in little is faithful also in much (Luke 16:10). Do everything with all your heart, as for the Lord (Colossians 3:23).","Discover your gift, develop it daily, and use it to serve (1 Peter 4:10)."]]];
